+# Source probe — BATCH-DIFFERENTIAL-0001
+
+Reserved for the Rust-side half of the differential corpus. The reference
+behavior of the source repository is already defined by the library's own unit
+tests and doctests under `oauth2/src`, which use an injected fake HTTP client and
+assert the exact request, response and error.
+
+Rather than duplicate those tests, this batch records the mapping from each
+DIFFERENTIAL observation to the reference test(s) that implement it in
+`probe-manifest.json`. The source side is observed by running:
+
+```
+cargo test -p oauth2 --lib -- --exact <module>::tests::<test>
+```
+
+for each listed test against `/input/source`, then projecting the result onto the
+normalized observable surface recorded in
+`shared/batches/BATCH-DIFFERENTIAL-0001/corpus.json`.
+
+The runner entrypoint `source/runner` belongs exclusively to the INTEGRATION
+batch and is intentionally absent here.
